//! check
//! error: LYS-PAR0045
//! stderr-has: links of 'else if' nest too deep
//! since: 1.0.0
// §2 rule 1: a link of an `else if` chain nests as a block does — past the bound the chain is
// refused, with the form that takes any number of cases, where four hundred of them overflowed
// the compiler (S7e1).
